  "details": "The following are assuming VRC+ is active on the account.\n\n1. Open VRChat.\n\n2. Open your web-browser.\n\n3. Log into VRChat on your browser.\n\n4. Delete one of your uploaded emojis.\n\n5. Upload a new emoji.\n\n6. In VRChat [ingame] use some of your custom emojis, including or excluding ones that no longer exist.\n\n7. Error message.",
